{"id":"en-199","title":"What Accessories Are Included In the Vertigo Package?","family":"vertigo","topic":"guides","read_minutes":1,"source_url":"https://wiki.1laser.com/vertigo/accessories-in-the-vertigo-package","source_updated_at":"2026-03-26T09:40:50.432Z","body_html":"<div><h2 id=\"accessories-in-the-vertigo-package\"> Accessories In the Vertigo Package</h2>\n<p>After unpacking, please verify the following accessories and their quantities. If any items are missing, contact official customer support. If everything is complete, proceed with use according to their functions and installation instructions.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/vertigo/components/pj-3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></figure>\n<p> </p>\n<figure>\n  <table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Item</td>\n        <td>Quantity</td>\n        <td>Function</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Power Cable</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Connects the device to the power supply to provide electrical power.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>USB Cable</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Connects the device to a computer for data and file transfer.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Smoke Exhaust Hose &amp; Clamp</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Used for smoke extraction and securing the exhaust hose.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Hex Key</td>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td> Used for removing/installing the enclosure and adjusting the optical path.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>USB Drive</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Contains the user manual and basic calibration files (the card includes standard backlash parameters).</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Spirit Level Vial</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td>Used for leveling the device. </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Key</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Used to lock/unlock the machine enclosure.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Extended Jaws</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td> Extension accessories for the clamping system.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Jaws</td>\n        <td>6</td>\n        <td> Standard clamping components.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Exhaust Fan</td>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td> Used for ventilation and smoke extraction.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</figure>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"accessories-in-the-vertigo-package","text":"Accessories In the Vertigo Package"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}